WEBVTT


00:01:31.862 --> 00:01:39.356
SYNCHRONIZATION-SUBTITLES
VASILISIF!!!!!


00:01:45.862 --> 00:01:48.656
<i>There's a hundred thousand streets 
in the city.</i>


00:01:49.749 --> 00:01:51.849
<i>You don't need to know the route.</i>


00:01:52.349 --> 00:01:56.327
<i>You give me a time and a place,
I give you a five minute window.</i>


00:01:57.475 --> 00:02:00.820
<i>Anything happens in that five 
minutes and I'm yours.</i>


00:02:01.464 --> 00:02:03.065
<i>No matter what.</i>


00:02:03.459 --> 00:02:07.283
<i>Anything happens a minute either side 
of that and you are on your own.</i>


00:02:08.956 --> 00:02:10.388
<i>Do you understand?</i>


00:02:14.039 --> 00:02:15.626
<i>Good.</i>


00:02:18.394 --> 00:02:21.021
<i>And you won't be able to reach me 
on this phone again.</i>


00:02:53.604 --> 00:02:55.197
Hey, there you are!


00:02:56.115 --> 00:02:57.733
She's down there.


00:02:57.917 --> 00:03:00.035
Plain Jane boring, 
just like you asked for,


00:03:00.136 --> 00:03:04.248
but I dropped in 300 horses 
on the inside, she is gonna fly!


00:03:05.971 --> 00:03:08.196
You look like a zombie kid.
You getting any sleep?


00:03:09.395 --> 00:03:13.576
Can I offer you some Benzedrine,
Dexedrine, caffeine, nicotine?


00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.360
Oh you don't smoke, that's right.
Better off.


00:03:18.254 --> 00:03:19.788
There she is!


00:03:21.298 --> 00:03:25.004
"Chevy Impala". The most popular car 
in the state of California.


00:03:26.345 --> 00:03:28.339
No one will be looking at you.


00:04:36.132 --> 00:04:37.878
<i>...Robert Victor 3.</i>


00:04:38.162 --> 00:04:41.806
<i>License 5-1-4, Robert Victor 3...</i>


00:04:54.683 --> 00:04:57.902
<i>Code 30 Ringer located
at 421 South Alameda.</i>


00:05:00.721 --> 00:05:02.933
<i>Reports of shots fired at Code 30.</i>


00:05:16.061 --> 00:05:17.317
Come on!


00:05:18.711 --> 00:05:20.120
Where the fuck is he? Come on!


00:05:23.185 --> 00:05:24.746
<i>Unit 5, what's your 20?</i>


00:05:25.398 --> 00:05:28.178
<i>We are approximately two minutes
from that location.</i>


00:05:35.805 --> 00:05:38.088
Come on, man! Where the hell are you?


00:05:42.393 --> 00:05:44.089
Come on!


00:05:45.823 --> 00:05:47.189
Come on!


00:05:48.436 --> 00:05:50.333
Come on! Get in! Get in! Get in!


00:05:51.439 --> 00:05:53.061
Go, go, go, go, go!


00:05:55.852 --> 00:05:58.925
<i>All unit be advised,
possible vehicle in question;</i>


00:05:59.055 --> 00:06:01.226
<i>Late model, silver impala.</i>


00:06:28.696 --> 00:06:32.042
<i>1-Adam-3, South Bay at Seventh, clear.</i>


00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:35.996
<i>Roger, 1-Adam-3.</i>


00:06:37.606 --> 00:06:39.733
<i>Requesting air unit support.</i>


00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.366
<i>Unit 5 to dispatch,
heading eastbound on Sixth.</i>


00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.660
<i>Copy that, Unit 5.</i>


00:07:10.289 --> 00:07:11.815
<i>Base to Air 3.</i>


00:07:11.981 --> 00:07:14.117
<i>Any sign of that silver impala?</i>


00:07:14.802 --> 00:07:16.920
<i>Air 3 to Base. Negative.</i>


00:07:24.303 --> 00:07:27.680
<i>Got a visual, heading west on
Seventh Street bridge.</i>


00:07:30.985 --> 00:07:33.669
<i>Copy, Air 3. All units, be advised...</i>


00:07:58.612 --> 00:08:01.931
<i>Base, Air 3 here. We've lost visual
on suspect.</i>


00:08:12.204 --> 00:08:15.559
<i>Base to Air 3. Possible gang shooting
in progress.</i>


00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:18.281
<i>Proceed immediately
to Washington and La Brea.</i>


00:08:19.105 --> 00:08:21.159
<i>Roger, dispatch. I'm out.</i>


00:08:36.259 --> 00:08:38.151
<i>All westbound units be advised.</i>


00:08:38.252 --> 00:08:41.579
<i>Suspect last seen near
Seventh Street and Santa Fe.</i>


00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.174
<i>Dispatch, this is 1-Adam-6.</i>


00:09:11.292 --> 00:09:14.454
<i>Possible suspect vehicle,
sighted at stoplight.</i>


00:09:14.638 --> 00:09:16.105
<i>Stand by.</i>


00:09:16.841 --> 00:09:18.249
<i>Roger, Unit 6.</i>


