00:11:33.604 --> 00:11:37.913
<i>~ I'm gonna show you where it's dark ~</i>


00:11:38.265 --> 00:11:41.692
<i>~ but have no fear ~</i>


00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:49.467
<i>~ There's something inside you ~</i>


00:11:51.353 --> 00:11:54.430
<i>~ it's hard to explain ~</i>


00:11:56.333 --> 00:12:01.228
<i>~ They're talking about you, boy ~</i>


00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:05.107
<i>~ but you're still the same ~</i>


00:12:07.011 --> 00:12:10.654
<i>~ There's something inside you ~</i>


00:12:12.016 --> 00:12:15.451
<i>~ it's hard to explain ~</i>


00:12:17.554 --> 00:12:22.291
<i>~ They're talking about you, boy ~</i>


00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:26.087
<i>~ but you're still the same ~</i>


00:12:28.065 --> 00:12:33.062
<i>~ There's something inside you ~</i>


00:12:33.177 --> 00:12:38.641
<i>~ it's hard to explain ~</i>


00:12:38.742 --> 00:12:43.980
<i>~ They're talking about you, boy ~</i>


00:12:44.084 --> 00:12:47.817
<i>~ but you're still the same ~</i>


00:13:34.876 --> 00:13:37.169
- What floor?
- Fourth. Thanks.


00:14:21.412 --> 00:14:22.880
Hey, kid... 


00:14:23.212 --> 00:14:24.681
you know what?


00:14:28.758 --> 00:14:30.806
Director wants to see a rollover.
Are you okay with that?


00:14:31.783 --> 00:14:33.778
Remember, if you don't feel good,
just abort the shot.


00:14:34.118 --> 00:14:35.679
There's no shame in that, all right?


00:14:36.259 --> 00:14:37.866
I mean, you're... You're doubling 
for the star.


00:14:37.972 --> 00:14:39.663
You' re not like a day player 
or anything.


00:14:40.916 --> 00:14:42.544
And I got you $500 more. Huh?


00:14:43.184 --> 00:14:44.725
Of course we split that.


00:14:45.091 --> 00:14:46.136
You okay? Ready to go?


00:14:47.078 --> 00:14:48.804
All right, I'm counting on you.


00:15:04.054 --> 00:15:05.432
<i>Excuse me, pal. I just 
need a minute here.</i>


00:15:05.556 --> 00:15:09.218
<i>You see, before I put you on camera, 
I need you to sign this... contract.</i>


00:15:09.323 --> 00:15:11.194
It just basically releases liability
to the company


00:15:11.295 --> 00:15:14.105
in case you die, get maimed,
or seriously injured.


00:15:15.062 --> 00:15:17.733
And... action!


00:15:25.159 --> 00:15:26.668
<i>All right, that's a cut!</i>


00:15:27.126 --> 00:15:28.764
Oh Kid! That was fantastic.


00:15:28.865 --> 00:15:30.166
Just fantastic!


00:15:30.286 --> 00:15:32.843
Okay, how you doing? You all right?


00:15:33.285 --> 00:15:35.413
You were good. You were good.
That was perfect...


00:16:31.350 --> 00:16:33.259
<i>- You're a monkey!
- No, you're the monkey!</i>


00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:34.836
<i>- You're a monkey! 
- You're the monkey!</i>


00:16:34.937 --> 00:16:35.885
<i>You're a monkey!</i>


00:16:35.986 --> 00:16:37.564
Hey, tell me one thing.


00:16:38.045 --> 00:16:39.490
- I love you.
- I love you.


00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:28.097
Ah!


00:17:35.267 --> 00:17:38.216
- Where should I put these?
- In the kitchen. Thank you.


00:17:40.877 --> 00:17:42.603
Just be a second.


00:17:53.315 --> 00:17:54.699
Scary.


00:17:58.252 --> 00:18:00.005
Hey, you want a toothpick?


00:18:06.742 --> 00:18:08.505
You want a glass of water?


00:18:08.631 --> 00:18:10.565
Okay.


00:18:20.631 --> 00:18:22.452
Thanks.


00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.316
So, did you just moved to L.A?


00:18:30.018 --> 00:18:31.912
No, I've been here for a while.


00:18:32.863 --> 00:18:35.140
- You are just new here?
- Mmm-hmm.


00:18:41.301 --> 00:18:43.273
That's Benicio's father.


00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:47.143
Where is he?


00:18:47.794 --> 00:18:49.471
He's in prison.


00:18:50.587 --> 00:18:52.389
Oh.


00:18:52.491 --> 00:18:54.350
What do you do?


00:18:56.528 --> 00:18:58.513
I drive.


00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:02.142
Like a limo driver?


00:19:02.835 --> 00:19:05.753
- No, like for movies.
- Oh.


00:19:07.086 --> 00:19:09.358
Doing all the car chases and stuff?


00:19:10.067 --> 00:19:11.710
Yeah.


00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.111
Isn't that dangerous?


00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:25.540
It's only part time.


00:19:26.202 --> 00:19:28.192
Mostly I work at the garage.


00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.030
- Where?
- Receda Boulevard.


00:19:40.472 --> 00:19:42.498
I gotta go.


00:19:43.951 --> 00:19:45.460
Okay.


00:19:47.521 --> 00:19:48.905
Thanks for the water.


00:19:49.081 --> 00:19:50.891
- Say bye.
- Bye.


00:20:29.089 --> 00:20:31.380
<i>Mr. Rose, your food sir. Okay.</i>


00:20:31.787 --> 00:20:34.977
<i>Chicken chow mein and... 
some peking duck.</i>


00:20:35.889 --> 00:20:37.662
Where are the chopsticks?


00:20:37.964 --> 00:20:41.595
<i>- Oh, you know. The guy just...</i>
- Go get them. Go get them.


00:20:41.671 --> 00:20:44.090
I don't want that. I don't want that. 
You eat it.


00:20:44.732 --> 00:20:46.855
Chopsticks and a fortune cookie.


00:20:47.145 --> 00:20:49.691
Put out the fucking cigarette,
I'm eating!


00:20:50.017 --> 00:20:51.766
I'm sorry.


00:20:51.834 --> 00:20:52.895
What's the matter with you?


00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:56.712
I'm just... What happened to all the
ashtrays in this town?


00:20:57.393 --> 00:21:00.969
You run a perfectly good business. 
I don't know, why you wanna change that now.


00:21:01.503 --> 00:21:03.931
You know how much
my business made last year?


00:21:04.331 --> 00:21:05.902
Thirty grand.


00:21:06.006 --> 00:21:07.690
I can build a car in six months 


00:21:07.791 --> 00:21:10.566
and in six seconds these jerks 
write it off as a stunt


00:21:10.668 --> 00:21:12.595
that won't even make it to the movie.


00:21:13.696 --> 00:21:16.735
See, all I need is a hard used stock car.


00:21:17.124 --> 00:21:18.391
That's all.


00:21:18.394 --> 00:21:22.540
And I figure we start off small 
town circuit; we work our way up.


00:21:22.641 --> 00:21:25.101
Once we get to the show,
we're talking millions.


00:21:25.302 --> 00:21:27.899
<i>- I have the chopsticks, sir.</i> 
- Yeah. Where's the cookies?


00:21:28.268 --> 00:21:30.758
<i>- Uh... You know, I...
- Forget it. Forget it.</i>


00:21:32.009 --> 00:21:33.627
So, you still haven't given me a number.


00:21:34.110 --> 00:21:35.948
All right... 


00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.008
430,000 dollars.


00:21:38.148 --> 00:21:39.849
Oh...!


00:21:40.049 --> 00:21:43.945
Mr.Rose, I wouldn't come to you with this, 
unless I was absolutely sure about it!


00:21:44.146 --> 00:21:46.303
<i>How can you be sure, Shannon?</i>


00:21:46.415 --> 00:21:49.668
What do you got that the big 
professional race teams don't?


00:21:51.582 --> 00:21:53.429
I got the driver.


00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:55.790
You just told me they had 
half a dozen drivers.


00:21:55.891 --> 00:21:57.192
Not like this one.


00:21:57.958 --> 00:21:59.695
This kid is special.


00:21:59.736 --> 00:22:02.656
I've been working with him for a while.
I've never seen anything like it.


00:22:03.356 --> 00:22:05.583
If I had the money, I'd back him myself.


00:22:05.684 --> 00:22:07.585
Yeah, but you don't have the money.


00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:11.724
Mr.Rose, you put this kid behind 
the wheel...


00:22:12.624 --> 00:22:14.525
there's nothing he can't do.


00:22:15.019 --> 00:22:17.300
There's money here. You can't lose.


00:22:18.433 --> 00:22:20.749
Fuck you eating chink food in 
my fucking restaurant?


00:22:20.949 --> 00:22:23.886
What's a Jew doing running a pizzeria?


00:22:24.086 --> 00:22:25.987
You remember Shannon.


00:22:29.133 --> 00:22:32.001
Take a fucking hike. I want to talk 
to my partner.


00:22:34.914 --> 00:22:36.973
Hah, I'm just fucking with you.


00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:39.735
How you doing Shannon?
How's the fucking leg?


00:22:40.587 --> 00:22:42.588
I've paid my debt.


00:22:43.588 --> 00:22:46.759
I'll think about it. Okay?


00:22:47.201 --> 00:22:49.293
But I wanna meet the kid first.


00:22:49.394 --> 00:22:51.396
That's all I ask.


00:23:03.058 --> 00:23:05.043
Come on, I want you to meet somebody.


00:23:06.343 --> 00:23:08.096
Whatever you do like about the car,
don't say anything.


00:23:08.238 --> 00:23:10.123
I want to drive the price down a little bit.


00:23:10.623 --> 00:23:12.675
Kid, I want you to meet Mr.Bernie Rose.


00:23:13.969 --> 00:23:15.945
Nice to meet you.


00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:23.135
My hands are a little dirty.


00:23:23.673 --> 00:23:25.663
So are mine.


00:23:29.643 --> 00:23:31.587
Good driving out there.


00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:34.200
Thanks.


00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:37.150
He's a good kid.


00:23:37.359 --> 00:23:40.168
So? What do you think?
Do we get the 400?


00:23:41.429 --> 00:23:43.649
I'll give you 300 for 70 percent.


00:23:47.085 --> 00:23:48.986
Done!


00:23:50.230 --> 00:23:52.000
Right. Good.


00:23:53.275 --> 00:23:55.276
You won't be sorry!


00:24:01.131 --> 00:24:02.699
- I'm Shannon. 
- Hi. Irene.


00:24:02.800 --> 00:24:05.799
- Irene. How can I help you?
- Uh... It just broke down.


00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:07.579
<i>- Just broke down. Just like that. 
- Mmm-hmm.</i>


00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:10.599
<i>You want me to take a look at it?
All right. Uh...</i>


00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.398
<i>We got all our bays full.</i>


00:24:12.499 --> 00:24:15.496
<i>Um, hey pal, just drop it down here.
We'll push it in all right?</i>


00:24:15.878 --> 00:24:18.116
We wanna... push her into number three.


00:24:18.507 --> 00:24:20.468
- The car. Not you.
- Oh good.


00:24:21.408 --> 00:24:23.129
- Hi.
- Hi.


00:24:24.474 --> 00:24:26.858
- Uhh...You two know each other?
- Don't!


00:24:27.200 --> 00:24:28.641
Ohh... look at that.


00:24:28.742 --> 00:24:30.902
- We're neighbors.
- Neighbors, very good.


00:24:31.013 --> 00:24:32.772
Well, we'll try to be neighborly too.


00:24:53.483 --> 00:24:55.011
You blinked!


00:24:55.265 --> 00:24:56.971
What?


00:24:57.472 --> 00:24:59.607
- Can I call a cab from here?
- Yeah, sure.


00:25:01.243 --> 00:25:03.194
What am I talking about?


00:25:03.394 --> 00:25:05.672
You and the kid are neighbors, right?
He can take you home.


00:25:05.972 --> 00:25:07.916
Oh no. I'd feel bad.


00:25:08.142 --> 00:25:11.561
Oh, no...Don't even think twice about it.
He'd be happy to do it.


00:25:12.061 --> 00:25:14.062
He's a good guy.


00:25:14.740 --> 00:25:17.618
You know, he walked into my shop here
about five or six years ago...


00:25:18.378 --> 00:25:21.212
right out of the blue, asking for a job.


00:25:21.612 --> 00:25:23.857
So, I put him to the test,
see what he could do.


00:25:25.317 --> 00:25:26.652
The kid's amazing. 


00:25:27.152 --> 00:25:29.930
So, I hired him on the spot.
Boom!


00:25:30.590 --> 00:25:34.076
At about half the wages i normally pay.
He didn't even blink an eye.


00:25:35.076 --> 00:25:37.204
Hey kid, come over here for a second,
will you?


00:25:38.288 --> 00:25:41.041
And I have been exploiting him ever since.


00:25:43.502 --> 00:25:45.353
Shhhh...Don't tell him!


00:25:45.613 --> 00:25:48.173
It looks like we have a bigger problem
than I thought.


00:25:48.773 --> 00:25:51.301
And we're gonna have to keep
the car here for a few days.


00:25:51.901 --> 00:25:55.389
So, I offered your services to take,
Benicio and Irene home.


00:25:55.689 --> 00:25:57.690
That be okay?


00:26:00.243 --> 00:26:02.412
- Yeah sure.
- Yeah.


00:26:04.314 --> 00:26:07.234
I don't have wheels... on my car.


00:26:07.900 --> 00:26:10.664
- Okay.
- It's one think you should know about me.


00:26:10.835 --> 00:26:12.845
- Well, put the tyres on.
- You got five minutes?


00:26:12.946 --> 00:26:14.549
Yeah.


00:26:37.139 --> 00:26:39.091
Hey, do you wanna see something?


00:26:42.294 --> 00:26:43.854
Yeah.


00:26:46.932 --> 00:26:48.430
Okay.


00:26:52.570 --> 00:26:56.761
<i>~ Back against the wall and odds ~</i>


00:26:56.766 --> 00:26:59.981
<i>~ with the strength of a will and a cause ~</i>


00:27:00.186 --> 00:27:04.256
<i>~ your pursuits are called outstanding ~</i>


00:27:04.540 --> 00:27:07.968
<i>~ you're emotionally complex ~</i>


00:27:08.936 --> 00:27:12.914
<i>~ Against the grain of dystopic claims ~</i>


00:27:13.015 --> 00:27:17.102
<i>~ on the thoughts your actions entertained ~</i>


00:27:17.186 --> 00:27:22.983
<i>~ and you have proved to be ~</i>


00:27:23.943 --> 00:27:28.284
<i>~ A real human being ~</i>


00:27:28.389 --> 00:27:32.325
<i>~ and a real hero ~</i>


00:27:32.685 --> 00:27:36.579
<i>~ Real human being ~</i>


00:27:36.839 --> 00:27:41.026
<i>~ and a real hero ~</i>


00:27:41.135 --> 00:27:45.088
<i>~ Real human being ~</i>


00:27:52.296 --> 00:27:56.608
<i>~ A pilot on a cold, cold morn' ~</i>


00:27:56.709 --> 00:28:00.403
<i>~ one-hundred fifty-five people on board ~</i>


00:28:00.588 --> 00:28:04.299
<i>~ all safe and all rescued ~</i>


00:28:04.400 --> 00:28:08.111
<i>~ from the slowly sinking ship ~</i>


00:28:08.654 --> 00:28:13.205
<i>~ Water warmer than his head so cool ~</i>


00:28:13.309 --> 00:28:17.083
<i>~ in that tight bind knew what to do ~</i>


00:28:17.186 --> 00:28:22.917
<i>~ and you have proved to be ~</i>


00:28:23.719 --> 00:28:27.881
<i>~ A real human being ~</i>


00:28:32.520 --> 00:28:36.348
<i>~ real human being ~</i>


00:28:43.806 --> 00:28:45.502
That was good. 


00:28:46.242 --> 00:28:47.951
He had a good time.


00:28:56.374 --> 00:28:57.921
Me too.


00:29:04.727 --> 00:29:07.629
Sorry, if I put you on the spot
showing up like that.


00:29:07.930 --> 00:29:09.915
It's okay.


00:29:32.839 --> 00:29:35.182
I'm not doing anything this weekend.


