01:04:28.015 --> 01:04:29.114
Don't worry about it.


01:04:29.215 --> 01:04:30.683
I'll take care of it.


01:05:02.533 --> 01:05:03.983
Where's Cook?


01:05:04.084 --> 01:05:05.935
He's in the dressing room.


01:05:06.604 --> 01:05:08.534
Where's that?


01:05:08.635 --> 01:05:10.389
It's over there.


01:05:40.170 --> 01:05:42.754
Whose money do I have?


01:05:43.274 --> 01:05:45.283
Don't worry, they're gonna 
come get it.


01:05:45.826 --> 01:05:47.360
No! No!


01:05:48.260 --> 01:05:49.721
Call them.


01:05:49.822 --> 01:05:51.364
Somebody call Nino!


01:06:02.923 --> 01:06:05.252
Do you remember this?


01:06:28.536 --> 01:06:30.502
<i>Hello?</i>


01:06:30.904 --> 01:06:32.022
Nino?


01:06:32.123 --> 01:06:35.765
<i>No, sorry pal. Why don't you call 
back later? We're closed.</i>


01:06:35.951 --> 01:06:39.245
I could, but I think Nino would be upset
that you made him wait.


01:06:40.064 --> 01:06:42.014
<i>Can I ask what this is about?</i>


01:06:42.800 --> 01:06:44.751
I have something of his.


01:06:45.502 --> 01:06:47.236
<i>And that would be?</i>


01:06:48.088 --> 01:06:49.689
A million dollars.


01:06:51.057 --> 01:06:52.892
<i>Please hold.</i>


01:06:59.793 --> 01:07:02.401
<i>You have something
fucking belongs to me?</i>


01:07:07.686 --> 01:07:09.683
Seems that way.


01:07:11.607 --> 01:07:13.904
And you're calling me...


01:07:14.805 --> 01:07:16.465
...why?


01:07:17.159 --> 01:07:19.852
You expect me to buy my own shit 
back from you?


01:07:19.953 --> 01:07:21.962
<i>I'm not selling it.</i>


01:07:22.247 --> 01:07:23.773
I'm gonna give you a time and a place,


01:07:23.874 --> 01:07:26.067
and you're gonna come and get it.


01:07:26.168 --> 01:07:28.135
Do you understand?


01:07:29.129 --> 01:07:31.155
<i>And what do you get out of it?</i>


01:07:32.132 --> 01:07:34.066
Just that.


01:07:34.468 --> 01:07:36.260
Out of it.


01:07:37.096 --> 01:07:39.180
<i>And your partners are happy with that?</i>


01:07:41.100 --> 01:07:43.150
I don't have any partners.


01:07:43.936 --> 01:07:47.814
You discuss this with... anybody else?


01:07:49.082 --> 01:07:50.808
<i>No, just you.</i>


01:07:52.111 --> 01:07:54.937
You're not very good at this, are you?


01:08:06.075 --> 01:08:08.826
<i>Go check out who this fucking guy is.</i>


01:08:47.283 --> 01:08:49.285
Can I talk to you for a minute?


01:08:50.586 --> 01:08:52.578
Can't talk, I have to go.


01:08:55.776 --> 01:08:57.950
Can I just walk with you for a...


01:08:58.091 --> 01:08:59.585
Yeah.


01:09:19.289 --> 01:09:21.307
I have to tell you something.


01:09:27.247 --> 01:09:30.750
Standard was into some...


01:09:31.291 --> 01:09:34.194
...guys in prison for a lot of money.


01:09:36.465 --> 01:09:39.759
And they were gonna hurt you and 
Benicio if he didn't pay it.


01:09:42.996 --> 01:09:45.864
He asked me for my help.


01:09:48.287 --> 01:09:50.502
Everything went wrong, you know.


01:09:54.066 --> 01:09:56.008
I'm sorry.


01:10:00.796 --> 01:10:02.648
I still got the money.


01:10:06.511 --> 01:10:08.972
You can have it, if you wanted to.


01:10:11.416 --> 01:10:13.492
You can take Benicio and...


01:10:24.972 --> 01:10:27.848
I just thought you could get out 
of here, if you wanted.


01:10:31.386 --> 01:10:33.312
I could come with you.


01:10:37.109 --> 01:10:39.159
I could look out for you.


01:10:43.994 --> 01:10:45.734
Sorry, uh...


01:10:46.074 --> 01:10:47.438
...wrong floor.


01:14:10.622 --> 01:14:12.698
They came to my apartment, Shannon.


01:14:14.291 --> 01:14:16.259
How'd they know where I live?


01:14:18.038 --> 01:14:19.572
I told you, I was gonna call Bernie.


01:14:19.673 --> 01:14:22.033
I just wanted him know that...
that it wasn't about...


01:14:22.134 --> 01:14:23.392
That you're not interested in the money,


01:14:23.493 --> 01:14:25.344
that you just did it for the girl.


01:14:28.142 --> 01:14:29.960
- What the fuck did you just say?
- No, no!


01:14:31.443 --> 01:14:33.861
- I just...
- Why did you have to fucking tell them about Irene?


01:14:33.962 --> 01:14:36.097
- Calm down!
- You told them about Irene!


01:14:36.198 --> 01:14:38.149
Calm down, kid. Just calm down.


01:14:38.533 --> 01:14:40.551
I should fucking kill you!


01:14:40.652 --> 01:14:41.994
You told them about Irene!


01:14:42.095 --> 01:14:44.046
I just...I just wanted him to know...


01:14:45.307 --> 01:14:47.225
...that as soon as you return the money,
that was the end of it.


01:14:47.326 --> 01:14:50.498
That's all. I didn't know...
How was I supposed to know?


01:14:50.599 --> 01:14:53.180
How was I supposed to know that? Okay?


01:14:53.281 --> 01:14:55.908
Look, let me, let me just talk to Bernie.
Okay?


01:14:56.993 --> 01:14:59.353
Why you got to fuck everything up, Shannon?


01:14:59.454 --> 01:15:02.631
<i>How was I supposed to know,
everything led to Nino?</i>


01:15:08.688 --> 01:15:10.156
They're gonna come looking for me.


01:15:10.257 --> 01:15:12.051
And they're gonna come for you.


01:15:12.152 --> 01:15:13.959
Do you understand?


01:15:14.701 --> 01:15:17.638
You gotta get out of here.
And you gotta get out now.


01:15:18.418 --> 01:15:19.815
- Listen to me.
- Oh, God.


01:15:19.916 --> 01:15:21.580
Listen to me, Shannon.


01:15:21.681 --> 01:15:23.143
Listen.


01:15:23.244 --> 01:15:25.813
You get out of here and you never 
fucking come back.


01:15:27.274 --> 01:15:29.224
You never come back.


01:15:34.886 --> 01:15:36.848
What are you gonna do?


01:15:53.867 --> 01:15:55.759
I already gave you my advice!


01:15:56.545 --> 01:15:59.155
You should have taken the money
and left the guy alone.


01:15:59.256 --> 01:16:00.564
It's not that simple Bernie.


01:16:00.665 --> 01:16:03.748
No, of course not! Now that it's 
bounced up in your face!


01:16:03.849 --> 01:16:06.797
You know, I owe you this guy. Just give me 
a little time and I'll get rid of him.


01:16:07.058 --> 01:16:09.081
Shut the fuck up.


01:16:09.816 --> 01:16:11.742
You fucking monkey!


01:16:11.999 --> 01:16:15.405
The money.. belongs to some half-assed 
wise guy out of Philly.


01:16:15.506 --> 01:16:17.345
Now, I got tipped off...


01:16:17.446 --> 01:16:19.875
...he was stashing a million bucks 
in a pawnshop.


01:16:19.976 --> 01:16:21.685
He was gonna invest it here in L.A.


01:16:21.786 --> 01:16:23.729
He was gonna set up a rival operation.


01:16:24.080 --> 01:16:26.398
So, you stole from the East Coast mob?


01:16:26.499 --> 01:16:29.652
No, I stole from some jumped-up punk


01:16:29.753 --> 01:16:31.329
who was trying to step on our action.


01:16:31.430 --> 01:16:32.980
Yeah? Then why didn't you come to me,


01:16:33.081 --> 01:16:35.382
before you set up this dummy robbery?


01:16:37.269 --> 01:16:39.370
Before you hire this piece of shit.


01:16:39.471 --> 01:16:40.913
This is something off to the side, Bernie.


01:16:41.014 --> 01:16:42.231
I didn't wanna involve you in this.


01:16:42.332 --> 01:16:44.350
Well, I'm involved now!


01:16:46.311 --> 01:16:48.212
Let me tell you something.


01:16:48.313 --> 01:16:49.521
Anybody...


01:16:50.255 --> 01:16:54.104
...anybody, finds out you stole 
from the Family, 


01:16:54.205 --> 01:16:55.618
we're both dead.


01:16:55.719 --> 01:16:57.496
What fucking Family?


01:16:58.533 --> 01:17:01.116
The Family who still calls me 
a fucking kike?


01:17:02.369 --> 01:17:04.236
To my face?


01:17:05.105 --> 01:17:07.234
Yeah, I'm 59 years old Bernie.


01:17:07.335 --> 01:17:10.317
They still pinch my cheek 
like I'm some fucking kid.


01:17:11.753 --> 01:17:13.028
Family...


01:17:13.129 --> 01:17:15.781
The money always flows up, Izzy.


01:17:15.882 --> 01:17:17.583
You know that.


01:17:18.910 --> 01:17:21.220
That's why this driver's gotta go, Bernie.


01:17:22.709 --> 01:17:24.373
He's gotta go.


01:17:24.474 --> 01:17:27.625
And your pal, Shannon. I mean these
are the only two guys who can...


01:17:27.726 --> 01:17:29.994
...tie me to this robbery.


01:18:09.085 --> 01:18:12.071
Now it's your turn to clean up after me.


01:19:15.598 --> 01:19:17.503
All these priceless cars...


01:19:17.604 --> 01:19:20.097
One would think you'd have better locks.


01:19:22.202 --> 01:19:23.917
Why?


01:19:24.018 --> 01:19:26.178
Door is always open to you.


01:19:26.279 --> 01:19:28.129
Going somewhere?


01:19:29.232 --> 01:19:31.158
Uh...


01:19:33.286 --> 01:19:35.120
Thinking about it.


01:19:35.939 --> 01:19:37.989
I'm looking for your driver.


01:19:40.268 --> 01:19:42.611
You break in here,
I figure it's bad news.


01:19:42.971 --> 01:19:44.430
No, Shannon. 


01:19:44.531 --> 01:19:46.248
It's bad luck.


01:19:46.725 --> 01:19:50.477
2,000 heists a year in this city,


01:19:50.578 --> 01:19:52.571
he has to pick the wrong one.


01:19:53.364 --> 01:19:54.598
He tried to put it right.


01:19:54.699 --> 01:19:57.059
Well, he picked the wrong guy for that too.


01:19:57.494 --> 01:20:01.171
My partner is a belligerent asshole,
with his back against the wall.


01:20:02.048 --> 01:20:04.057
Right now, so am I.


01:20:05.085 --> 01:20:07.761
If I don't set this straight,
I'm in big trouble.


01:20:11.382 --> 01:20:13.350
Any idea where he might be?


01:20:16.054 --> 01:20:18.013
Mexico.


01:20:18.384 --> 01:20:20.932
Or maybe it was Belize.


01:20:24.138 --> 01:20:25.862
Really?


01:20:32.038 --> 01:20:34.663
I was getting excited 
about this whole thing.


01:20:35.398 --> 01:20:37.783
My name on a car!


01:20:37.884 --> 01:20:40.169
I mean, look how beautiful.


01:20:40.902 --> 01:20:43.380
I wanted to see my name on this thing.


01:20:45.884 --> 01:20:48.727
I think we would have made a go 
with this business.


01:21:03.943 --> 01:21:06.798
Don't worry. Don't worry, that's it!


01:21:06.899 --> 01:21:07.779
It's done!


01:21:08.723 --> 01:21:11.033
There's no pain, it's over. It's over!


01:23:03.805 --> 01:23:08.358
<i>~ Oh, my love ~</i>


01:23:08.985 --> 01:23:13.988
<i>~ look and see ~</i>


01:23:14.615 --> 01:23:23.338
<i>~ the sun rising from the river ~</i>


01:23:25.852 --> 01:23:31.997
<i>~ nature's miracle once more ~</i>


01:23:32.759 --> 01:23:37.236
<i>~ will light the world ~</i>


01:23:38.581 --> 01:23:42.167
<i>~ But this light ~</i>


01:23:42.268 --> 01:23:47.339
<i>~ is not for those men ~</i>


01:23:47.440 --> 01:23:50.984
<i>~ still lost in ~</i>


01:23:51.085 --> 01:23:55.863
<i>~ an old black shadow ~</i>


01:23:57.742 --> 01:24:03.855
<i>~ Won't you help me to believe ~</i>


01:24:03.956 --> 01:24:08.718
<i>~ that they will see ~</i>


01:24:09.712 --> 01:24:13.115
<i>~ a day ~</i>


01:24:13.216 --> 01:24:17.452
<i>~ A brighter day ~</i>


01:24:17.553 --> 01:24:21.915
<i>~ when all the shadows ~</i>


01:24:22.016 --> 01:24:26.420
<i>~ will fade away ~</i>


01:24:26.521 --> 01:24:30.882
<i>~ that day I'll cry ~</i>


01:24:30.983 --> 01:24:34.883
<i>~ that I believe ~</i>


01:24:34.984 --> 01:24:43.183
<i>~ that I believe ~</i>


01:24:43.788 --> 01:24:48.066
<i>~ Oh, my love ~</i>


01:24:48.167 --> 01:24:53.238
<i>~ high above us ~</i>


01:24:53.339 --> 01:24:56.508
<i>~ the sun now ~</i>


01:24:56.592 --> 01:25:01.095
<i>~ embraces nature ~</i>


01:25:03.182 --> 01:25:09.296
<i>~ And from nature we should learn ~</i>


01:25:09.397 --> 01:25:19.261
<i>~ that all can start again ~</i>


01:25:20.199 --> 01:25:25.620
<i>~ as the stars must fade away ~</i>


01:25:26.706 --> 01:25:37.628
<i>~ to give a bright new day ~</i>


01:25:49.187 --> 01:25:51.162
What the fuck was that?


01:26:23.738 --> 01:26:25.080
Let's get out of here.


01:26:25.181 --> 01:26:26.806
Yeah.


01:28:28.551 --> 01:28:30.338
<i>Hello?</i>


01:28:30.981 --> 01:28:34.333
<i>You know the story about the
scorpion and the frog?</i>


01:28:37.087 --> 01:28:40.331
<i>Your friend Nino didn't make it
across the river.</i>


01:28:42.601 --> 01:28:44.903
<i>I think this is gone on long enough.</i>


01:28:46.575 --> 01:28:49.165
You see any reason for it to continue?


01:28:50.868 --> 01:28:52.885
What do you say we meet?


01:28:55.514 --> 01:28:57.273
<i>Why?</i>


01:28:58.584 --> 01:29:00.306
Well...


01:29:00.407 --> 01:29:03.321
...you, me and your girlfriend 
are the only players left.


01:29:04.256 --> 01:29:06.507
<i>How's that for a reason?</i>


01:29:08.437 --> 01:29:09.686
<i>When?</i>


01:29:09.787 --> 01:29:11.763
<i>Tomorrow.</i>


01:29:11.934 --> 01:29:13.656
<i>There's a place on Sherman Way,</i>


01:29:13.757 --> 01:29:15.767
<i>it's a restaurant called "The Great Wall".</i>


01:29:16.088 --> 01:29:17.827
<i>You know it?</i>


01:29:45.956 --> 01:29:47.965
<i>Can I talk to you?</i>


01:29:50.421 --> 01:29:52.303
<i>I won't keep you long.</i>


01:29:57.076 --> 01:30:00.478
<i>I have to go somewhere and
I don't think I can come back.</i>


01:30:05.242 --> 01:30:07.754
<i>But I just want you to know.</i>


01:30:07.855 --> 01:30:10.405
<i>Getting to be around you and Benicio</i>


01:30:12.691 --> 01:30:15.160
<i>was the best thing that ever 
happened to me.</i>


01:31:07.586 --> 01:31:09.430
Did you bring the money?


01:31:15.501 --> 01:31:17.405
Here's what I'm prepared to offer.


01:31:18.307 --> 01:31:20.558
You give me the money, the girl is safe.


01:31:21.407 --> 01:31:23.294
Forever. Nobody knows about her.


01:31:23.395 --> 01:31:25.363
She's off the map.


01:31:26.874 --> 01:31:28.983
I can't offer you the same.


01:31:30.294 --> 01:31:32.278
So, this is what I would suggest.


01:31:33.447 --> 01:31:36.307
We conclude our deal, 
we'll shake hands.


01:31:36.408 --> 01:31:38.743
You.. start the rest of your life.


01:31:41.413 --> 01:31:43.985
Any dreams you have, or plans,


01:31:44.086 --> 01:31:46.067
or hopes for your future...


01:31:46.168 --> 01:31:48.545
...I think you're gonna have 
to put that on hold.


01:31:49.713 --> 01:31:52.640
For the rest of your life, you're gonna 
be looking over your shoulder.


01:31:52.741 --> 01:31:55.120
I'm just telling you this because...


01:31:55.221 --> 01:31:57.327
...I want you to know the truth.


01:31:58.155 --> 01:32:00.130
But the girl is safe.


01:32:20.216 --> 01:32:22.236
Where's the money now?


01:32:23.787 --> 01:32:25.656
It's in the car.


01:32:33.442 --> 01:32:35.074
Come on.


01:34:55.711 --> 01:34:59.414
<i>~ Real human being ~</i>


01:35:15.711 --> 01:35:19.757
<i>~ A pilot on a cold, cold morn' ~</i>


01:35:19.858 --> 01:35:23.660
<i>~ one-hundred fifty-five people on board ~</i>


01:35:23.761 --> 01:35:27.180
<i>~ all safe and all rescued ~</i>


01:35:27.281 --> 01:35:31.668
<i>~ from the slowly sinking ship ~</i>


01:35:31.769 --> 01:35:36.446
<i>~ Water warmer than his head so cool ~</i>


01:35:36.547 --> 01:35:40.368
<i>~ in that tight bind knew what to do ~</i>


01:35:40.469 --> 01:35:46.933
<i>~ and you have proved to be ~</i>


01:35:47.034 --> 01:35:51.229
<i>~ A real human being ~</i>


01:35:51.330 --> 01:35:54.899
<i>~ and a real hero ~</i>


